PHP University Practical Programs 

18) a)Write a PHP program to create an array of fruits and display them in a list. 

<?php 

$fruits = array("Apple", "Banana", "Mango", "Orange", "Grapes"); 

echo "<h2>List of Fruits</h2>"; 

echo "<ul>"; 

foreach ($fruits as $fruit) { 

 echo "<li>" . $fruit . "</li>"; 

} 

echo "</ul>"; 

?> 

(b) Extend the program to sort the array in alphabetical order before displaying it. 

<?php 

$fruits = array("Mango", "Apple", "Grapes", "Banana", "Orange"); 

sort($fruits); 

echo "<h2>Fruits in Alphabetical Order</h2>"; 

echo "<ul>"; 

foreach ($fruits as $fruit) { 

 echo "<li>" . $fruit . "</li>"; 

} 

echo "</ul>"; 

?>
